---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import CTASection from '../components/CTASection.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="FIKRA is a youth entrepreneurship organisation helping young people turn ideas into sustainable enterprises."
>
  <Section>
    <PageHero
      eyebrow="About FIKRA"
      title="Talent is everywhere. Opportunity should be too."
      intro="FIKRA supports young people to build businesses that last — with training, mentorship and access to the networks and capital that are usually out of reach."
    />
  </Section>

  <Section tone="white">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Our mission</h2>
        <p>
          To help young people turn ideas into sustainable enterprises that
          create work, income and dignity — for themselves and for the people
          they employ.
        </p>
        <h2>Our vision</h2>
        <p>
          A generation of young builders who can start, grow and sustain
          businesses from where they are, with what they have.
        </p>
        <h2>What we believe</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Practical over theoretical.</strong> Founders learn by doing.</li>
          <li><strong>Local knowledge.</strong> Our work is shaped with the communities we serve.</li>
          <li><strong>Honesty.</strong> We report what works — and what does not.</li>
          <li><strong>Durability.</strong> We build for enterprises that outlast our support.</li>
          <li><strong>Youth-led.</strong> Young people shape our programmes, not just attend them.</li>
          <li><strong>Together.</strong> Founders, mentors and partners grow further as a community.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Our story</h2>
        <p>
          FIKRA began with a simple observation: the young people with the best
          ideas were not always the ones with the best access to support. What
          started as informal mentoring grew into structured programmes that
          now carry founders from first idea to established business.
        </p>
        <h2>Governance</h2>
        <p>
          FIKRA is governed by its constitution and a board of directors, and
          reports on progress against a three-year strategic plan. Our org chart
          and key documents are available on request.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section tone="soft">
    <div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <a class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-border bg-surface p-6 hover:border-primary/40" href="/programs">
        <h2 class="font-bold text-ink">Programs</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">See how we support founders at each stage.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-border bg-surface p-6 hover:border-primary/40" href="/team">
        <h2 class="font-bold text-ink">Team</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">Meet the people behind FIKRA.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-border bg-surface p-6 hover:border-primary/40" href="/impact">
        <h2 class="font-bold text-ink">Impact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">What our work has changed so far.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <CTASection />
</BaseLayout>
